/E (Thapar Institute of Engineering and Technology has, for more than seven decades, stood for academic excellence, integrity and a deep commitment to nation-building. Our strength lies in our people: dedicated faculty, curious students, committed staff and an accomplished alumni community spread across the world. As the landscape of education and work changes rapidly, we remain focused on nurturing graduates who think critically, act ethically and lead with purpose. Through interdisciplinary learning, impactful research, global partnerships and close engagement with industry and society, the Institute continues to grow as a vibrant centre of knowledge and innovation. I invite every member of the Thapar family to aspire high and contribute to a sustainable future.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
