/E (Prof. Padmakumar Nair is the Vice Chancellor of Thapar Institute of Engineering and Technology \(TIET\), Patiala. He joined TIET in July 2013, where he led the LM Thapar School of Management and played a key role in establishing the Thapar School of Liberal Arts and Sciences. He holds PhDs from the University of Twente and the University of Tokyo, as well as an MBA from Heriot-Watt University. He is passionate about developing and leading sustainable enterprises.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
