/P 301 0 R
/E (At Thapar Institute of Engineering and Technology, our aim is to offer an education that combines strong fundamentals with hands-on experience and real-world relevance. We continuously strengthen our curriculum, teaching practices and quality processes so that our programmes meet global standards. Experiential learning, international collaborations, and meaningful engagement with industry help our students develop the skills, confidence, and values needed to succeed in a fast-changing world. Equally, we encourage our faculty and researchers to pursue work that is rigorous, collaborative, and useful to society. I am proud of the Thapar community's spirit of excellence, and I encourage everyone to keep learning, innovating, and taking the Institute to greater heights.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
