/E (Prof. Ajay Batish is the Pro Vice-Chancellor of Thapar Institute of Engineering and Technology \(TIET\), Patiala, and a Professor of Mechanical Engineering. He earned his PhD from Thapar University and, before joining academia, spent nearly a decade heading Quality Assurance in industry. He spearheaded the development of the Experiential Learning Centre in collaboration with the University of Waterloo. His research spans advanced manufacturing, process optimization, ergonomics, and quality engineering, with numerous publications and projects funded by DST, DRDO, UGC, AICTE, and Industry.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
