592 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
/E (On behalf of the Centre of Excellence in Data Science and AI, I extend my warm greetings to all participants of the workshop. Why do advanced autonomous agents and robots still fail to collaborate well with people? Building better human-AI and human-robot systems requires more than computing and mechatronics. It requires us to understand how users of these tools want and need to interact with them. In this workshop, we turn to research on how humans interact with each other, and use insights from this research to build human-AI and human-robot systems. Using explainable artificial intelligence as a primary case study, we demonstrate how models of human-to-human explanation can be operationalised to build explainable AI systems that users can more intuitively understand, trust, and use.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
