/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 305 0 R
/E (The workshop aims to bring together eminent academicians, researchers, industry leaders, and students to explore emerging developments in Robotics, Artificial Intelligence, and Intelligent Systems. With distinguished national and international speakers, interactive technical sessions, and industry-led hands-on activities, the event will provide a vibrant platform for knowledge exchange and innovation, bridging the gap between academic research and real-world applications. We hope it will inspire new ideas, foster interdisciplinary collaborations, and encourage the next generation of researchers and innovators. I warmly welcome all participants, speakers, industry partners, and students to these two exciting days of learning, interaction, and collaboration.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
