/E (Prof. Shyamanta Moni Hazarika is a DST-INAE Abdul Kalam Technology Innovation National Fellow. He is a Professor of Mechanical Engineering and of the Mehta Family School of Data Science and AI at IIT Guwahati, where he leads the Biomimetic Robotics and Artificial Intelligence Lab. His research focuses on bionic prosthetics and robotic neurorehabilitation, integrating AI and machine learning with robotics and neuroscience to improve the lives of individuals with neuromotor disabilities. He previously served as Professor of Computer Science and Engineering at Tezpur University and as a substitute Professor at the University of Bremen, Germany. He holds a B.E. from Assam Engineering College, an M.Tech. in Robotics from IIT Kanpur and a PhD in Artificial Intelligence from the University of Leeds, England.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [11]
>>
