696 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (Dr. Rajesh Kumar is a Principal Scientist at Addverb, where he leads the development of advanced robotic platforms across hardware, software and AI. His technical expertise spans robot kinematics and dynamics, nonlinear and model predictive control, trajectory optimization, visual and LiDAR SLAM, reinforcement learning, vision-language-action models, and world models. His work covers manipulation, legged locomotion, autonomous navigation, teleoperation, robot control and cognition, integrating algorithms with actuators, sensing, and real-time robot software. He leads development across cobots, quadrupeds, dual-arm systems, and humanoids.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
