/E (Dr. Madan Dabbeeru is the Founder of Eizen AI, with over 22 years of AI research and engineering across the USA, Dubai and Bangalore. He has led AI initiatives at Rakuten India as Head of Research and was a key architect at the unicorn startup Phenom People, delivering AI across defense, healthcare, banking, and e-commerce. His work includes unmanned vehicles for the US Navy and Air Force, AI for cancer research and AI that generates AI. He holds a Post-Doc and PhD in Cognitive Robotics from the University of Maryland, IIT Kanpur and BITS Pilani.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [10]
