773 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 316 0 R
/E (Artificial intelligence is reshaping robotics beyond perception and decision-making by bringing intelligence to the entire development lifecycle. This talk explores how AI can support key stages of robot development, from platform design and sensor integration to perception, planning and control, and how combining AI with simulation and model-based engineering can shorten development cycles, and improve design exploration. It also introduces Agentic AI as an emerging approach for orchestrating end-to-end engineering workflows, with examples using the MATLAB and Simulink Agentic Toolkits showing how AI agents can interact with models, simulations, and tools while supporting human-guided workflows, contributing to the emerging vision of Physical AI.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
