/E (Mr. Saurabh Joshi is Regional Account Manager at Noraxon USA Inc., supporting researchers and institutions across India. He brings around 14 years of experience in scientific measurement technologies and lab solutions, including technical support, product training and work with biomechanics, and rehabilitation equipment. He works closely with academic, clinical and industry teams, helping institutions assess their requirements, plan laboratories, and make effective use of their equipment. At Noraxon, his responsibilities include business development, institutional relationships, and coordination with local partners. He holds an MBA in Analytics and Business Development.)
