/P 322 0 R
/E (ABOUT THE SPEAKER)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
870 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 322 0 R
/E (Mr. Puneet Jindal is Founder & CEO of Labellerr AI and Robotics Data. He holds a B.E. in Computer Science from Thapar Institute and completed a Data Science and AI programme at the Indian School of Business. He spent nine years building AI software and data products at Walmart, Delhivery, RateGain and startups across logistics, e-commerce, travel, and healthcare. He founded Labellerr AI, a data annotation platform used by research groups and companies including Stanford, MIT, Toyota Research Institute, and Volvo. In 2026, he launched Robotics Data to build the real-world data collection layer for robot learning, and has collected about 5,000 hours of egocentric data on Indian and global factory floors.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
