884 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 323 0 R
/E (This hands-on workshop introduces an end-to-end workflow for developing an autonomous robotic system, starting from model import and controls, through interfacing with ROS, to hardware deployment, using MATLAB, Simulink, and Simscape. Participants will learn to create robot models from CAD and URDF files, apply PID and reinforcement learning-based control, connect MATLAB and Simulink with ROS/ROS 2, perform co-simulation in virtual environments, and explore hardware integration and model validation through examples involving robotic manipulators and mobile robots.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
